   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Bound of form X log T + o(log T), recorded as limsup. Regret is defined as max_i E[sum l_I - l_i], equals sum Delta_i P_i in stochastic setting (pseudo-regret). sigma_i^2 is the loss variance of arm i."
  },
